{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972580/extras/0297433e4fab1ce1349387bfe035b895.poster.avif?t=1758884524\" width=558 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972580/extras/0297433e4fab1ce1349387bfe035b895.webm?t=1758884524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972580/extras/0297433e4fab1ce1349387bfe035b895.mp4?t=1758884524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flappy Witch is a short but enchanting adventure about a young witch and her missing cat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly through mysterious lands, face dangerous monsters, and uncover the story behind your magical companion\u2019s disappearance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972580/extras/cd79e7ccaab2ac96ffc41793362fbe9b.webp?t=1758884524\" width=150 height=46 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Fast-paced flying gameplay with simple controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Cute pixel art style with a magical atmosphere</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 A short but charming story about a witch and her cat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Various enemies and challenges to overcome</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you guide the witch through the skies and reunite her with her cat?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong>playtime: &lt;1hour</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972580/extras/ced974466